 ame siwo trɔ ɖe mɔ gɔglɔ̃ dzi la,","poem":1},{"text":"Yehowa atsɔ wo aƒu gbe, kpe ɖe nu vɔ̃ɖi wɔlawo ŋu.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ŋutifafa nenɔ Israel dzi.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/125.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/126.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ewe_bib/PSA/124.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}